    <h1 class="page-title">Primary Statutory Sources & Regulatory Registry</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">
      ZeroDebt India prioritizes primary legal sources over secondary commentary. Below is the full bibliography of Central Acts of Parliament, Reserve Bank of India circulars, and judicial precedents underpinning our research.
    </p>
  </div>

  <article class="prose">
    <h2>1. Reserve Bank of India (RBI) Regulatory Directives</h2>
